 in the rate’s denominator.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The concluding summary accurately connects the classification criteria to inclusion in the denominator. The temporary-layoff exception is presented as an exception to active search, consistent with the source.","materiality":"This is the piece’s concluding explanation of how the criteria affect the rate."}]}

